COMPILATION OF: E49F1

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49F1

   1 a 0000 E49F1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] ORDERED RELATION `< ' between two qualified FIXED
   4 a 0006      members, equal extents. NEVER probed: helper, parking, branch
   5 a 0006      byte are ALL open.  Candidates: ?SCCCM + a flag-conditional
   6 a 0006      skip (C2/CA are equality branches, cannot express <); a
   7 a 0006      DIFFERENT helper (PLILIB.IRL shows a second ?CX* family -- a
   8 a 0006      prior from a preserved historical input, not a law); or a
   9 a 0006      PASS-2 refusal like E48E6's BIT REQ. Nothing from =/^= may be
  10 a 0006      presupposed. */
  11 c 0006   dcl
  12 c 0006     1 rec,
  13 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  14 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  15 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  16 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  17 c 0006   if rec.na < rec.nb then k = 1;
  18 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  19 c 003F   stop;
  20 a 0042 end E49F1;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
